{"version":1,"content":"<p>荷里活男星布斯韋利士（Bruce Willis）幾年前因失智症與失語症而宣布息影，他的健康情況一直備受關注。</p><p>而早前有知情者向英國傳媒爆布斯的近況，其中提及他目前的行為好像嬰兒般。</p><p>消息傳出後布斯與影星前妻狄美摩亞（Demi Moore）的32</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:09:50.921130+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:42:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T01:03:09.243430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:03:09.243430+00:00","content_hash":"e5bb331f5894b203efa608fd0784d0243a8d7aafef8c99bdbcb100d2eb71fb9c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}